stateDiagram-v2
  state "New web pod" as StatelessReplacement
  state "Identity held" as IdentityHeld
  state "New db-1" as StatefulReplacement
  [*] --> Ready
  Ready --> Unknown: Lease stale past grace interval
  Unknown --> Waiting: Unreachable NoExecute taint
  Waiting --> Ready: Heartbeat returns before expiry
  Waiting --> Deleting: Toleration expires
  Deleting --> StatelessReplacement: ReplicaSet restores count
  Deleting --> IdentityHeld: StatefulSet old object remains
  IdentityHeld --> StatefulReplacement: Verified shutdown and old object cleared
